{"unit_id":"riffkit__dsh-plugin#feature-1","repo":"riffkit/dsh-plugin","commit":"bcbb2ef7301c33388077ed2d6a277b83b2ef4dcb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Riffkit for DSH 的功能「短视频改编」：分析来源视频的情绪公式并将其转化为用户自己的故事。用户可提供 TikTok 链接、上传视频或已分析模板作为素材，再选择 Adapt 模式生成新内容。","source":"generated","evidence":["skills/riffkit/SKILL.md:20-24","skills/riffkit/SKILL.md:44-46"]}
{"unit_id":"riffkit__dsh-plugin#feature-2","repo":"riffkit/dsh-plugin","commit":"bcbb2ef7301c33388077ed2d6a277b83b2ef4dcb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Riffkit for DSH 的功能「Swap 翻拍」：以来源视频为基础保留镜头、剪辑与时序，只替换人物、产品或场景。用户给出来源视频并指定要改变的内容，输出沿用原片结构的翻拍视频。","source":"generated","evidence":["skills/riffkit/SKILL.md:22-24","skills/riffkit/SKILL.md:45-46"]}
